  "strategy": "Captain America, Team Leader gives every Hero that enters vigilance and haste and puts a +1/+1 counter on it and on himself, so the deck curves out on Heroes that attack the turn they land and grow as the team does. Avengers Tower, Plaza of Heroes and the Talismans fix three colours toward them; Herald's Horn, Door of Destinies and Kindred Discovery reward naming Hero; Iron Man, Armored Avenger turns every draw into another counter and lends modified attackers flying; and Thor, Asgard's Avenger adds 1 to each hit the team lands on an opponent's side. Heroic Sacrifice and Gift of Immortality keep the key Hero alive through a sweeper, while Swords to Plowshares, Austere Command, Avenge and Arcane Denial answer the rest.",
